	"identifying_description": "Large carpet with large central medallion and quarter medallions on a red field.  Each medallion and quarter medallion is edged with an ornamental border that appears to derive from Chinese cloud motifs.  Split-leaf motifs (rumi) in the field. Colors (10): red. orange, mustard yellow, dark purple, bright dark blue, medium blue, dark green, medium green, dyed brown, white. Wefts are dark red wool.  Selvedges are original.  One end (about 12-18\") is completely rewoven.",
